sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Sidecar<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker Plugin<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant Decode as Decode Pod (vllm)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Pod (vllm)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Nixl as nixl RDMA<br/>5600/TCP
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC
    participant Jaeger as Jaeger<br/>4317/TCP

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 1: Standard Inference Request

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP 8081
    Envoy->>EPP: ext_proc ProcessingRequest<br/>gRPC 9002 (localhost)
    EPP->>EPP: Evaluate InferencePool<br/>membership & load
    EPP-->>Envoy: Set x-gateway-destination-endpoint<br/>header response
    Envoy->>Decode: Forward request (ORIGINAL_DST)<br/>HTTP 8000
    Decode-->>Envoy: JSON response<br/>(OpenAI-compatible)
    Envoy-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Prefill,Nixl: Flow 2: Disaggregated KV-Cache Transfer

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP 8081
    Envoy->>EPP: ext_proc routing<br/>gRPC 9002
    EPP-->>Envoy: Route to prefill pod
    Envoy->>Prefill: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8000
    Prefill->>Prefill: Compute prefill (attention)
    Prefill->>Nixl: KV-cache state<br/>RDMA 5600 (bypasses mesh)
    Nixl->>Decode: Transfer KV-cache<br/>nixlv2 connector
    Decode->>Decode: Continue decode phase
    Decode-->>Envoy: Streamed response<br/>HTTP 8000
    Envoy-->>Client: Streamed JSON response

    Note over Decode,Jaeger: Flow 3: Observability Pipeline

    Decode->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC 4317
    Prefill->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC 4317
    EPP->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC 4317
    OTel->>Jaeger: Batch forward<br/>gRPC 4317
